    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d423">

                <pb facs="0754" n="622" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg622"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.6362/7–345: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 423<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent—niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-03T10:00:00+02:00">July 3, 1945—10
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6674. The following reply to the President’s message (Deptel 5117, June 24<anchor n="1" xml:id="d423-f1"/>) has just been
                    received from the Prime Minister: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Prime Minister to President Truman. Personal and top secret.</p>
                        <p>I am in full agreement in principle with your proposal and a similar
                            directive to Field Marshal
                                Montgomery is being prepared. There are certain points on
                            which the Foreign Office are addressing the State Dept,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d423-f2"/> and
                            we should like to have these considered before despatching our
                            telegram.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
